  "applicationText": {
    "title": "万里の長城",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "l37-app-block-001",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "在前往八达岭的出租车里",
        "translationZh": "在前往八达岭的出租车里。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（在前往八达岭的出租车里）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l37-app-block-002",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l37-app-block-002-line-001",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "「八達嶺」までどのぐらいですか。",
            "translationZh": "到八达岭大约要多久？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：「八達嶺」までどのぐらいですか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l37-app-block-002-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson37/l37-app-block-002-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 10.1,
              "duration": 10.1,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:19:59.998Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "a131b0ef1446727599d9779fdfd3041b7b20bd83c1bfd79fa26c90c9a433822c"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l37-app-block-002-line-002",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "高速道路を利用すれば、だいたい１時間ぐらいです。鉄道なら２時間ちょっとですね。",
            "translationZh": "如果走高速公路，大约一小时。坐火车的话要两个多小时。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：高速道路を利用すれば、だいたい１時間ぐらいです。鉄道なら２時間ちょっとですね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l37-app-block-002-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson37/l37-app-block-002-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 5.5,
              "duration": 5.5,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:19:59.998Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "a131b0ef1446727599d9779fdfd3041b7b20bd83c1bfd79fa26c90c9a433822c"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l37-app-block-002-line-003",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "鉄道でも行くことができるんですか。",
            "translationZh": "坐火车也能去吗？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：鉄道でも行くことができるんですか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l37-app-block-002-line-003",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson37/l37-app-block-002-line-003.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 1.5,
              "duration": 1.5,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:19:59.998Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "a131b0ef1446727599d9779fdfd3041b7b20bd83c1bfd79fa26c90c9a433822c"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l37-app-block-002-line-004",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "ええ。鉄道で行くなら、北京北駅が便利です。直通列車が出ていますから。",
            "translationZh": "是的。如果坐火车去，从北京北站出发很方便，因为有直达列车。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：ええ。鉄道で行くなら、北京北駅が便利です。直通列車が出ていますから。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l37-app-block-002-line-004",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson37/l37-app-block-002-line-004.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 5.62,
              "duration": 5.62,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:19:59.998Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "a131b0ef1446727599d9779fdfd3041b7b20bd83c1bfd79fa26c90c9a433822c"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l37-app-block-003",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "抵达八达岭",
        "translationZh": "抵达八达岭。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（抵达八达岭）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l37-app-block-004",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l37-app-block-004-line-001",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "八達嶺は万里の長城の観光スポットの１つです。北京から近くて、いちばん有名な場所です。",
            "translationZh": "八达岭是万里长城的一个旅游景点，离北京近，也是最有名的地方。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：八達嶺は万里の長城の観光スポットの１つです。北京から近くて、いちばん有名な場所です。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l37-app-block-004-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson37/l37-app-block-004-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 7.38,
              "duration": 7.38,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:19:59.998Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "a131b0ef1446727599d9779fdfd3041b7b20bd83c1bfd79fa26c90c9a433822c"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l37-app-block-004-line-002",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "テレビとか写真集とかで見たことがありますが、実際に見ると、本当に規模が大きいですね。さすが「世界遺産」です。",
            "translationZh": "我在电视和画册上见过，但亲眼一看，规模真是宏大。不愧是“世界遗产”。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：テレビとか写真集とかで見たことがありますが、実際に見ると、本当に規模が大きいですね。さすが「世界遺産」です。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l37-app-block-004-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson37/l37-app-block-004-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 9.54,
              "duration": 9.54,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:19:59.998Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "a131b0ef1446727599d9779fdfd3041b7b20bd83c1bfd79fa26c90c9a433822c"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l37-app-block-005",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "登长城途中",
        "translationZh": "登长城途中。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（登长城途中）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l37-app-block-006",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l37-app-block-006-line-001",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "どうして「万里の長城」と言うんですか。",
            "translationZh": "为什么叫“万里长城”呢？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：どうして「万里の長城」と言うんですか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l37-app-block-006-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson37/l37-app-block-006-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.86,
              "duration": 2.86,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:19:59.998Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "a131b0ef1446727599d9779fdfd3041b7b20bd83c1bfd79fa26c90c9a433822c"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l37-app-block-006-line-002",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "長城の全長は５，０００キロメートル以上あります。中国では「１里」は0.5キロメートルですから、中国の単位に換算すれば、１万里を超えるんですよ。",
            "translationZh": "长城全长有五千多公里。在中国，一里是0.5公里，换算成中国的单位就超过一万里。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：長城の全長は５，０００キロメートル以上あります。中国では「１里」は0.5キロメートルですから、中国の単位に換算すれば、１万里を超えるんですよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l37-app-block-006-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson37/l37-app-block-006-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 12.22,
              "duration": 12.22,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:19:59.998Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "a131b0ef1446727599d9779fdfd3041b7b20bd83c1bfd79fa26c90c9a433822c"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l37-app-block-007",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "下长城途中",
        "translationZh": "下长城途中。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（下长城途中）"
